    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "9f3c3239796c2c2a",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"P(grant) 0.35. The prior-Term salience band for a once-distributed paid petition is roughly 5% (`baseline` band risk set). I am adjusting this upward significantly for several reasons. First, the City of San Antonio initially waived its right to respond, and the Court affirmatively requested a response on July 30. This signals serious interest from at least one Justice. Second, the petition is supported by twelve amicus briefs filed at the cert stage, representing a broad coalition ",
      "result_capture": "unobserved",
      "result_digest": null,
      "result_status": "unobserved",
      "retrieved_doc_date": null,
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T00:43:54.930Z",
      "tool": "write_file"
    },
    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "6e430a9a764f4928",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"Distributed once so far (prior to the requested response); expect at least one further distribution (a relist) once the respondent's brief is filed, followed by a decision on the petition. The Court called for a response, showing affirmative interest, and there is heavy amicus support. No CVSG is expected, as the case involves a municipal park and no federal statute, meaning the Solicitor General lacks a clear institutional interest.\\n\\nIf granted, the Court would likely take both q",
      "result_capture": "unobserved",
      "result_digest": null,
      "result_status": "unobserved",
      "retrieved_doc_date": null,
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T00:43:59.794Z",
      "tool": "write_file"
    },
    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "76469547cb804d5e",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"No corpus `fedcourts query` lookups were performed. \\n\\nWeb search performed for context and recent developments (since mode is `forward`):\\n- `google_web_search` for `\\\"Gary Perez\\\" \\\"Matilde Torres\\\" \\\"San Antonio\\\" \\\"Supreme Court\\\"` which confirmed the case's basic facts, the First Liberty Institute representation, and the Texas Supreme Court history.\", \"file_path\": \"data/cases/scotus/9026000015/events/evt-petition-disposition/predictions/gemini-baseline/20261005T231540Z/retriev",
